#: ../../../reference/interfaces/password-manager-service-interface.md:2
msgid "password-manager-service interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/password-manager-service-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"`password-manager-service` provides access to the global password manager "
"services provided by popular desktop environments, such as Secret Service "
"and KWallet, for example. This interface obviously gives privileged access "
"to sensitive information stored in the user's session."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/password-manager-service-interface.md:7
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **Transitional**: yes"
msgstr ""

